obs-server (0~git20260313.eec7f37-1obs14) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Enable the OBS Apache vhost and required modules during obs-api install.
  * Generate a local self-signed API certificate when no OBS certificate is
    present yet.
  * Run the Passenger app as www-data by handing the API app root to the
    Apache runtime user.
  * Bootstrap a dedicated obsapi MariaDB user and switch database.yml away
    from the root account for Debian testing runtime.
  * Drop the PassengerPreStart-in-vhost warning and set a writable HOME for
    Passenger app processes.

